[[File:Masori chaps detail.png|left|90px]]
The '''Masori chaps''' are obtained as a rare drop from the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They are part of the [[Masori armour]] set, and require level 80 [[Ranged]] and 30 [[Defence]] to equip. As with the rest of the armour set, the chaps boast the highest [[ranged]] attack bonus of any item in the [[legs slot]].

The chaps can be upgraded into a [[Masori chaps (f)|fortified variant]] by attaching three [[Armadylean plate]]s onto it, increasing the Defence level to equip it to level 80. This process requires level 90 [[Crafting]], and is not reversible.

